<title>INDIA: India's MICO 1996 net profit up.</title>
<headline>India's MICO 1996 net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		599.9   vs   525.8</p>
<p>    Total turnover     11,636.1   vs 9,314.9</p>
<p>    Div (in rupees)	  24.0   vs    22.0</p>
<p>    Gross Profit	  2,447.1   vs 2,108.0</p>
<p>    Interest costs	  142.8   vs    99.2</p>
<p>    Depreciation	  1,099.4   vs   833.0</p>
<p>    Tax on income	   605.0   vs   650.0</p>
<p>    Tax on dividend	   9.1   vs   --</p>
<p>distribution</p>
<p>Note: Auto components maker MICO Ltd is the Indian unit of Bosch of Germany.  -- Bombay newsroom (91-22-265 9000)</p>
</text>
